{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50113","headline":"游仙窟诗 游後园 · 崔五嫂","name":"游仙窟诗 游後园","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"极目游芳苑，相将对花林。\n露净山光出，池鲜树影沈。\n落花时泛酒，歌鸟或鸣琴。\n是时日将夕，携樽就树阴。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"崔五嫂","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_50113.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50113","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}